msgid "![Quantum circuit diagram](/img/qiskit-addons/cutting/03-wire-cutting-via-move-instruction/output_3.png)\n"
msgstr "![Diagrama de circuito quântico](/img/qiskit-addons/cutting/03-wire-cutting-via-move-instruction/output_3.png)\n"

#. type: Plain text
